<p>The <strong class="selflink">Core 2da</strong> defines <sup>[<a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Category%20-%20Articles%20with%20documentation%20requests" title="Category:Articles with documentation requests">Undocumented</a>]</sup>.
</p><p>The <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/2DA" title="2da">2da</a> is not listed in the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/M2DA%20base%202da" title="M2DA base 2da">M2DA_base 2da</a> and has not been assigned a <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/TABLE" title="TABLE *">TABLE_*</a> constant.
</p>
